  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Congo-Basin - Transparency and legality in timber sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased compliance with laws by operators placing timber on the supply chain ( Cameroon and the Republic of Congo). Increased compliance with legislation is essential to protect biodiversity and reduce emissions in the timber sector.</narrative>
  </description>
